r League) | 1.12 | 78% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Al+Kuwait+vs+Al+Sulaibikhat+prediction+19+October+2026) |\n| 18:00 | Bursaspor | Bursaspor v Pendikspor (1. Lig) | 1.38 | 74% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Bursaspor+vs+Pendikspor+prediction+19+October+2026) |\n| 19:00 | Al Hilal | Al Hilal v Al Hazem (Pro League) | 1.05 | 84% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Al+Hilal+vs+Al+Hazem+prediction+19+October+2026) |\n\nModel probabilities are footyalmanac's own; our backtest says bookmakers still price football slightly better than the model, so treat these as informed suggestions, not value bets. Accumulators multiply the bookmaker margin. Not betting advice."
